{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10570","headline":"行路难 · 冯着","name":"行路难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"男儿轗轲徒搔首，入市脱衣且沽酒。\n行路难，权门慎勿干，平人争路相摧残。\n春秋四气更回换，人事何须再三叹。\n君不见雀爲鸽，鹰爲鸠，东海成田谷爲岸。\n负薪客，归去来，龟反顾，鹤裴回，黄河岸上起尘埃。\n相逢未相识，何用强相猜。\n行路难，故山应不改，茅舍汉中在。\n白酒杯中聊一歌，苍蝇苍蝇奈尔何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯着","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}